        <body>
            <div xml:id="d328-a2">

                <pb facs="0769" n="721" sameAs="frus:frus1868p1/pg721"/>

                <head>Mr. Van Valkenburgh to Commodore Carter.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 48.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States in
                                Japan</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Yokohama,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-04-17"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 17, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> At a meeting of the representatives of the
                    treaty powers, held this afternoon, the following resolution was unanimously
                    adopted:</p>
                <p>“<hi rendition="#italic">Resolved,</hi> That in consequence of the arrival in
                    this harbor of Japanese steamers carrying large numbers of troops, the naval and
                    military officers of the respective forces be requested to take, as soon as
                    possible, such measures as are necessary to prevent the landing of armed
                    Japanese along the water front of Yokohama.”</p>
                <p>Will you please co-operate with your colleagues in carrying out this
                    resolution?</p>
                <p>I am, sir, very respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>R. B. VAN VALKENBURGH, <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Resident of the
                            United States in Japan.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Commander S. P. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carter</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Senior U. S. Naval Officer Commanding U. S. Steamer
                            Monocacy.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
